{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23843","headline":"荅崔十八见寄 · 白居易","name":"荅崔十八见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"明朝欲见琴尊伴，洗拭金桮拂玉徽。\n君乞曹州刺史替，我抛刑部侍郎归。\n倚疮老马收蹄立，避箭高鸿尽翅飞。\n岂料洛阳风月夜，故人垂老得相依。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23843.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23843","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}